WEBVTT

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:03.190
HeartCatch

00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:04.670
Precure!

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:08.230
HeartCatch Precure!

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:11.220
Now, all together

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:13.720
HeartCatch Precure!

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:16.690
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:24.300
Within each of our chests,

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:26.980
they begin to sprout

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:28.640
The seeds of the heart

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:29.940
are growing

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:32.570
bit by bit

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:33.230
Red,

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:33.860
white

00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:35.090
and yellow

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:37.850
It's because these blooming buds are

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:39.300
all varied colors

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:40.780
that they

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:42.980
shine so brightly!

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:48.270
That smile that you've nurtured

00:00:49.130 --> 00:00:50.790
with such care

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:53.510
will never wither

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:57.140
HeartCatch Precure!

00:00:57.140 --> 00:01:00.010
Now, all together

00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:02.470
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:05.140
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:10.020
They're always right by our sides

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:10.850
So together

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:14.700
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:17.660
bloom even more!

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:19.140
HeartCatch

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:20.680
Precure!

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:33.690
Our Hearts Unite as One<i>!</i>

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:33.690
Our Hearts Unite as One<i>!</i>

00:01:40.880 --> 00:01:44.430
Mirror, o mirror, grant we Precure your power!

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:14.940
The shining flowers illuminating the world.

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:20.990
HeartCatch Precure: Super Silhouettes!

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:28.470
Flowers, bloom tall!

00:02:32.970 --> 00:02:37.300
Precure HeartCatch Orchestra!

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:46.880
The HeartCatch Orchestra...

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:48.240
...didn't work!

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:56.350
A valiant attempt, Precure.

00:03:57.930 --> 00:04:02.090
But not nearly enough to defeat me.

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:08.970
My hatred will never be stopped.

00:04:11.590 --> 00:04:18.900
It will grow without end until it has torn all of existence apart.

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:25.560
It's time you saw...

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:31.110
that your love is powerless before the force of my hate!

00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:46.090
What's happening?!

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:55.690
Over here, girls!

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:26.680
Here he comes.

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:48.380
Who'dda thunk it?

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:53.250
These 14-year-old beauties
 having to face off against Dune.

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:55.350
"Beauties" is debatable.

00:07:00.410 --> 00:07:02.810
Let's go save our planet!

00:07:03.490 --> 00:07:04.330
Yeah!

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:09.360
Erika, you forgot. Yuri's seventeen.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:10.990
Oh man, I did!

00:07:11.620 --> 00:07:13.390
I'm sorry, Yuri!

00:07:15.390 --> 00:07:16.240
Go on.

00:07:17.520 --> 00:07:18.500
Okay!

00:07:24.770 --> 00:07:26.010
Moonlight!

00:07:27.870 --> 00:07:32.050
I'm sorry. I shouldn't have said all those things before.

00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:37.500
You were the one suffering, and I...

00:07:44.620 --> 00:07:51.820
Your kindness and concern taught me something incredibly precious.

00:07:55.090 --> 00:07:56.870
We had best join them.

00:08:02.300 --> 00:08:03.750
We'll be back soon, Grandma!

00:09:05.720 --> 00:09:06.560
Dune.

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:15.490
If we can't bring an end to your sadness, 
that just means we aren't strong enough.

00:09:18.980 --> 00:09:25.370
If your hatred can't be stopped, then that means our love isn't strong enough.

00:09:27.380 --> 00:09:28.230
So...

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:30.800
So we'll...

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:37.360
So we'll just have to combine our powers.

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:38.970
I'll help too!

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:39.850
Don't forget me!

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:41.040
Or me!

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:42.060
Or me!

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:43.320
Or me!

00:09:43.320 --> 00:09:47.100
We'll all combine our powers!

00:09:55.350 --> 00:09:59.910
Infinite possibilities are blooming before us.

00:10:01.090 --> 00:10:04.470
The grand flower, filling the cosmos!

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:21.350
With infinite power and infinite love...

00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:24.590
The Precure with star-filled eyes...

00:10:25.710 --> 00:10:29.800
HeartCatch Precure: Infinite Silhouette!

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:44.870
Your hatred will only bring you pain.

00:10:55.780 --> 00:10:58.010
Feel this love!

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:02.890
Precure Fist Punch!

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:16.640
Sorry, sorry!

00:12:16.640 --> 00:12:17.940
Erika!

00:12:18.730 --> 00:12:20.140
Hey, Tsubomi!

00:12:20.140 --> 00:12:22.280
Don't "Hey, Tsubomi" me!

00:12:22.280 --> 00:12:25.640
I know Futaba's cute, but stop poking her all the time!

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:29.570
It's hard enough to resist doing it without you there.

00:12:29.570 --> 00:12:31.470
Sorry, couldn't help it.

00:12:34.180 --> 00:12:36.190
I'll be back later, okay, Futaba?

00:12:36.590 --> 00:12:38.520
See you later, Mom!

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:40.070
Bye bye, Futaba!

00:12:42.650 --> 00:12:45.070
Must be nice having a little sister.

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:47.110
It really is.

00:12:47.110 --> 00:12:51.790
I mean, I <i>am</i> the little sister, so I could never really tell...

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:54.360
But it's nice.

00:12:56.130 --> 00:13:01.590
It feels weird thinking of you as the big sis, though!

00:13:01.990 --> 00:13:04.210
Hey, Sis, lend me some pocket money? {she specifically says "lend me 1000 yen" here but it feels a bit more natural this way to me?}

00:13:04.210 --> 00:13:06.550
Jeez, Erika!

00:13:15.090 --> 00:13:19.110
Hey, Itsuki! It's time for school!

00:13:20.700 --> 00:13:22.360
Morning, you two!

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:24.700
Good morning!

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:26.530
Good morning to you too, Satsuki!

00:13:27.900 --> 00:13:28.570
Morning.

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:33.000
I've just gotta get ready, so give me a sec!

00:13:33.630 --> 00:13:34.250
Whoa!

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:36.870
Kumo...

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:38.330
jacky?!

00:13:38.990 --> 00:13:41.650
Itsuki, Itsuki! Who is he?!

00:13:41.650 --> 00:13:44.010
Oh, I haven't introduced you yet.

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:47.880
He joined the Myoudouin School yesterday.

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:49.280
His name's Kumamoto.

00:13:50.380 --> 00:13:51.150
Kuma?

00:13:51.150 --> 00:13:52.430
Kumo?

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:54.830
That was such a shock!

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:57.100
It's too early for a surprise like that!

00:13:57.100 --> 00:14:03.940
When this Kumojacky lookalike just showed up and asked to join... Well, I screamed in shock!

00:14:06.180 --> 00:14:08.660
They must've returned back to normal!

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:14.990
He'd been comatose in the hospital and had no memory of the last few years.

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:18.460
Then somewhere out there...

00:14:18.980 --> 00:14:20.460
there's a Sasorina lookalike,

00:14:20.860 --> 00:14:23.870
and a Kobraja lookalike running around!

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:26.390
I bet there is!

00:14:27.390 --> 00:14:29.090
There has to be!

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:31.160
What about the Snackies, then?

00:14:31.160 --> 00:14:32.280
Them too!

00:14:32.280 --> 00:14:34.820
I bet they're all back to normal!

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:53.580
We've done the impossible!

00:14:54.900 --> 00:14:58.750
This world shines so bright, and it's all thanks to us!

00:15:02.990 --> 00:15:08.330
These 14-year-old beauties have saved the world!

00:15:08.330 --> 00:15:13.120
I'm getting so tired of this that I'm nearly up to here with it.

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:16.390
I'm amazed you can give the 
same speech every single day.

00:15:16.780 --> 00:15:21.390
I think Erika still can't quite believe we all became the Infinite Precure together,

00:15:21.390 --> 00:15:23.360
and she's been riding the high ever since.

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:27.550
"Infinite power" this, "infinite love" that.

00:15:27.550 --> 00:15:30.400
I don't think Erika was ready for it all.

00:15:30.690 --> 00:15:32.960
Quit treating me like a kid!

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:35.830
You two were the same!

00:15:36.170 --> 00:15:39.830
<i>We've done the impossible!</i>

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:42.580
You were right there with me giving that speech!

00:15:42.930 --> 00:15:43.880
Don't deny it!

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:46.250
You did it too!

00:15:47.020 --> 00:15:50.010
Infinite power! Infinite love!

00:15:50.490 --> 00:15:52.890
And we saved the world with it!

00:15:54.460 --> 00:15:58.780
How can anything in my life compete with that?!

00:15:58.780 --> 00:16:01.080
Woe is me!

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:02.030
Erika.

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:04.860
Are you still going on about that?

00:16:05.930 --> 00:16:10.520
Living in the past isn't going to get you anywhere.

00:16:10.520 --> 00:16:11.650
Sorry.

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:13.240
She's right!

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:17.190
You're gloating over what's been and gone, Erika!

00:16:18.060 --> 00:16:22.040
Life flows like the wind! It doesn't look back! It cannot look back!

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:26.880
Ichuki! It'sh been sho long!

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:30.320
And you're looking shuper lovely as ever, Ichuki!

00:16:30.320 --> 00:16:32.220
Thanks, Potpourri.

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:37.930
Chypre, how's the Great Heart Tree doing?

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:39.390
Good!

00:16:40.120 --> 00:16:44.790
Everyone's Heart Seeds are helping it to grow!

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:48.180
It'll be fine with us watching over it!

00:16:48.180 --> 00:16:50.770
I'm helping too!

00:16:56.740 --> 00:17:01.170
The Great Heart Tree has watched over us all for so long.

00:17:02.060 --> 00:17:09.310
And now, it's time for our hearts to help nurture and protect it.

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:16.840
We can't keep longing for 
infinite power and infinite love.

00:17:18.060 --> 00:17:19.970
We need to live our own lives.

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:21.890
Yeah!

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:30.210
Live our lives, sure... but what's that mean, exactly?

00:17:30.210 --> 00:17:35.480
Well, doing your best to realize your dreams is a good start.

00:17:35.480 --> 00:17:38.960
Erika, you still wanna be a pro fashion designer, right?

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:45.160
I'll do whatever I can to help your dream come true!

00:17:45.570 --> 00:17:47.590
Let me help too!

00:17:47.590 --> 00:17:48.480
And me!

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:49.180
And me!

00:17:49.180 --> 00:17:50.850
And me!

00:17:53.660 --> 00:17:54.800
And you, Yuri?

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:58.360
What's your dream?

00:17:58.360 --> 00:18:01.030
My dream?

00:18:02.780 --> 00:18:06.770
I suppose I'll have to think about what to do with my life.

00:18:07.420 --> 00:18:08.910
Our lives...

00:18:08.910 --> 00:18:10.980
Well, as for me...

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:16.940
I wanna keep training with the Myoudouin School, while trying to broaden my horizons.

00:18:16.940 --> 00:18:18.060
Doing what?

00:18:18.060 --> 00:18:19.630
That's a secret!

00:18:19.630 --> 00:18:21.690
You could at least tell <i>me</i>.

00:18:22.480 --> 00:18:23.120
What about you?

00:18:24.070 --> 00:18:28.080
I'd like to go up into space again.

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:31.210
But this time, by my own power!

00:18:32.760 --> 00:18:35.000
You wanna be an astronaut?!

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:39.450
That's my best friend for you! She dreams big!

00:18:39.450 --> 00:18:40.450
You're wrong.

00:18:40.450 --> 00:18:43.140
We're not best friends.

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:45.990
We're the bestest of friends!

00:18:47.940 --> 00:18:49.270
<i>If I can...</i>

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:52.550
<i>If I can make it up there,</i>

00:18:53.430 --> 00:18:58.240
<i>I want to help flowers bloom
 across the empty void of space.</i>

00:19:43.920 --> 00:19:47.070
<i>At least then, maybe he...</i>

00:20:43.230 --> 00:20:50.470
<i>The four of us Precure who defeated the Desert Apostles and saved the world</i>

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:56.230
<i>will fade into legend one day, and eventually be forgotten.</i>

00:20:58.140 --> 00:21:09.060
<i>But the year we spent becoming Precure together and chasing our dreams is something I'll never forget.</i>

00:21:10.340 --> 00:21:16.790
<i>Because they helped me grow, 
and helped me see a brighter future.</i>

00:21:17.340 --> 00:21:22.030
<i>This year has been a treasure beyond compare.</i>

00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:18.060
So come on, let's sing together in harmony!

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:22.230
Come on, all together now!

00:22:23.020 --> 00:22:25.730
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:27.110 --> 00:22:32.660
When you give life your all, within your heart

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:38.250
a shining flower begins to bloom

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:47.220
So when you feel like crying, raise your head

00:22:48.880 --> 00:22:53.930
and you'll see everyone's there by your side!

00:22:54.810 --> 00:23:00.020
So let's dance together, hand in hand!

00:23:02.690 --> 00:23:04.440
All those

00:23:04.600 --> 00:23:09.030
happy feelings will be shared amongst us!

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:14.280
Lose yourself in the melody!

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:16.950
Yay, yay, hey!

00:23:17.490 --> 00:23:21.160
And tomorrow will bring even more Hallelujahs!

00:23:21.370 --> 00:23:27.300
So come on! Let's make the Flowers of our Hearts bloom!

00:23:28.920 --> 00:23:31.340
With all our might!

00:23:32.010 --> 00:23:34.680
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:37.850
HeartCatch Precure!
